      "side": 1,
      "message": "The register type is W1C (Write 1 to clear), so I write 1s to clear all of them.\nI read the register and checked them zero after this. Here is the result for three REVOKE register values. (CTRL0: 4bytes, CTRL1: 4bytes, CTRL:2 bytes).\n\n[BEFORE]\nKEYMGR_CERT_REVOKE_CTRL: 828a02a8aaaaaaaaaaaa\n[AFTER]\nKEYMGR_CERT_REVOKE_CTRL: 00000000000000000000\n\n\nHere is another example of clearing this register value:\nhttps://cs.corp.google.com/piper///depot/google3/security/haven/cros_loader/cros_loader.c?rcl\u003d135157161\u0026l\u003d34",
